@startuml vector-service-flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
skinparam classBackgroundColor #E1BEE7

title Vector Service Search Processing

package "Vector Service" {
  class VectorService {
    +search_vectors_polymorphic()
    -execute_two_stage_search()
    -execute_standard_search()
  }
  
  class SearchContext {
    +collection_id: String
    +query_vector: Vec<f32>
    +k: usize
    +optimization_hints: Json
  }
  
  class SearchStrategy {
    <<enumeration>>
    Standard
    TwoStage
    Adaptive
  }
}

package "Storage Engines" {
  interface StorageEngine {
    +search_quantized()
    +search_full_precision()
    +get_vectors_by_ids()
  }
  
  class ViperEngine {
    +search_quantized()
    +search_full_precision()
    -use_parquet_pushdown()
  }
  
  class LsmEngine {
    +search_quantized()
    +search_full_precision()
    -use_bloom_filters()
  }
}

VectorService --> SearchContext : creates
VectorService --> SearchStrategy : selects
VectorService --> StorageEngine : delegates to

StorageEngine <|-- ViperEngine
StorageEngine <|-- LsmEngine

note bottom of VectorService
  Processes optimization hints
  and routes to appropriate
  search strategy
end note

@enduml